     1235     field fact-qnty as decimal
     1236     field free-qnty as decimal
     1237     field sts_err   as logical
     1238     field DelivCodeMis   as logical
     1239     field UnitCli   as character
     1240     field UnitCliQnty as decimal
     1241     field isMarking   as logical
     1242     field isArtic     as logical
     1243     field isWeight    as logical
     1244     field isVarWeight as logical
     1245     field isSelect    as logical
     1246     field markType    as character
     1247     field PieceTTH    as character
