     1269     field marking-string as character
     1270     field old-sts     as integer
     1271     field weight      as character
     1272     index pi  doc-level   sts
     1273     index pi2 mark-parent sts
     1274     index pi3 unit-ext
     1275     index pi4 mark obj-type obj-code gds-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     1276     index part gds-code obj-type obj-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     1277     index gds-code gds-code
