    11486         buf_ingr_fbr-line.price-sum-vat-base
    11487         buf_ingr_fbr-line.price-sum-vat-rubl
    11488       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 99 BY 8.63.
    11489   DEFINE FRAME D-FBR-DOC
    11490      br-comp AT ROW 5.25 COL 2
    11491      br-ingr AT ROW 15.13 COL 2
